# AI
# AI (Google 域名会匹配 YouTube, AI 必须在 Google 之前)
https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/DonJone/GinsRule-git@master/rules/loon/ai/ai-other.lsr, policy=AI与Google, tag=AI分流, enabled=true
# 流媒体 (YouTube 必须在 Google 之前, 否则被 google.mrs 截走)
